      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030201,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯？这张照片里的是……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302010051",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030201009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊——对了对了。想起来了！/n是我们兄弟姐妹一起演《白雪公主》时拍的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302010060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030201010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵，光是回想起来就想笑。/n记得当时是哥哥死活不肯让步，说什么要女装当主演。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302010070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030201011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“已经忘了”。/n不愧是哥哥，不方便的事马上就忘。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302010080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030201012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "FontSize": 2,
